   "fieldname": "purpose_and_approach",
   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "label": "Purpose and approach",
   "options": "<p>This check-in gives the employee and HR an early opportunity to confirm what is working, identify practical gaps and agree on any support needed for the remainder of probation.</p><h4>Purpose and approach</h4><p>HR conducts this check-in at the end of Month 1. It is a supportive onboarding conversation, not a performance appraisal. Record concise, factual notes and share information only with those who need it to provide support or address an identified concern.</p>"
